{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"sections\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S01\",\n      \"read\": \"all\",\n      \"long\": \"我忽然发现自己很想靠近对方，心里一热，连自己都意外。\",\n      \"follow\": \"能\",\n      \"why\": \"勉强\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S02\",\n      \"read\": \"all\",\n      \"long\": \"对方没因我露出一点在意而退开，仍亲近我，我才渐渐放松下来。\",\n      \"follow\": \"能\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S03\",\n      \"read\": \"all\",\n      \"long\": \"我想说喜欢这样，也想问对方是否一样；还没开口，念头就淡了。\",\n      \"follow\": \"能\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S04\",\n      \"read\": \"all\",\n      \"long\": \"我几乎想把藏着的话全告诉对方，也盼对方喜欢我不再小心收着的样子。\",\n      \"follow\": \"能\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S05\",\n      \"read\": \"main\",\n      \"long\": \"先前藏着时，我还能装作没那么在乎；如今被看出来，我心里空落落，连怎么相处都拿不准，便怕对方嫌我黏，熟悉的亲近也像隔了一层。\",\n      \"follow\": \"能\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S06\",\n      \"read\": \"all\",\n      \"long\": \"这回对方看出我有多在乎，跟我相处却一点没变，我才又能像从前一样自在。\",\n      \"follow\": \"能\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S07\",\n      \"read\": \"all\",\n      \"long\": \"想到这些日子对方总愿意和我待在一起，我渐渐觉得，对方或许有时也需要我陪着，和我待着也安心些。\",\n      \"follow\": \"能\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S08\",\n      \"read\": \"all\",\n      \"long\": \"想到对方也许也需要我陪，上回无意间露了心意，这回见对方仍亲近，我想主动些、大方回应；想着想着，也开始盼我们能这样好很久。\",\n      \"follow\": \"能\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S09\",\n      \"read\": \"all\",\n      \"long\": \"那点没底越来越具体：要是哪天对方不再需要我陪，连跟我待在一起也不愿意呢？想到这儿，我一下安静下来，刚才还敢盼那么远，这会儿却不敢再想。\",\n      \"follow\": \"能\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S10\",\n      \"read\": \"all\",\n      \"long\": \"我怕再猜下去连今天也过不踏实，便先不想以后，享受眼前的亲近；紧绷这才慢慢松开，心里亮堂得几乎想笑，也有点想哭。\",\n      \"follow\": \"能\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S11\",\n      \"read\": \"all\",\n      \"long\": \"轻松过去后，我忽然想，即使以后对方有时不需要我陪，我也还是愿意陪在身边，不想再藏起喜欢；这念头让我高兴得顾不上害臊，也觉得这么在乎对方没什么不好。\",\n      \"follow\": \"能\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S12\",\n      \"read\": \"all\",\n      \"long\": \"我现在只想把能给的都给对方，顾不上想对方会不会同样在乎我。\",\n      \"follow\": \"能\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S13\",\n      \"read\": \"all\",\n      \"long\": \"起初我怕给对方添负担，如今又怕有天对方不再需要我、连亲近也没了，便想藏回一点喜欢，少疼些；可我早已不能装作不在乎，刚才想对对方好也是真心的，真要收回反而难受。\",\n      \"follow\": \"能\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S14\",\n      \"read\": \"all\",\n      \"long\": \"既然对方已经看见我的喜欢，我就不再藏回去；以后怎样，等真的到了那时再说。\",\n      \"follow\": \"能\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"overall\": \"S05最容易读不完：18秒里能读完主句，但次组的话和词来不及全部看完。S13的主句虽然有时间读完，但前后几层担忧、想退缩又舍不得的转折挤在一起，第一遍不容易马上理清；S09也有类似的理解负担。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "b0ce59e0-6c32-4f45-9672-64ed967d55c4", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261105T124248007222Z", "elapsed_seconds": 165.11, "completed_utc": "2026-11-05T12:45:33.117603+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "4ff950415d5f3d49db590f6c49cb2fe9058f58b3a3603eea6b37a9a609c4c4fd", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261105T124248007222Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "dae6b277b7acf22dc6dd08dc3a8056fa3e7e36dc15a8c2c6998b84961ccc6ab1"}}}
